      "side": 1,
      "message": "i think this is an arbitrary assignment.  This assignment I think is actually a work-around for a different issue.  H1\u0027s SPI master resets into active drive, but this conflicts with other masters that need to drive SPI (EC/AP). So I think the intent here is to assign the SPI functions to some random GPIO to get it off the pins.  Mary is that right? I vaguely recall something like this.",
